  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb (Very Expensive)</p>\n<p><strong>Mods:</strong> All Non-Explosive Ranged Weapons</p>\n<p><em>Sometimes, you need a little extra ‘oomph’ to make an impact.</em></p>\n<p>When making an Attack with the weapon, if the attack’s damage does not surpass the target’s SP, roll 1d6 and add the result to the attack’s total damage before armor. If this new value surpasses the target’s SP, then the attack deals damage and ablates SP as normal. This extra d6 is not used to determine the incurring of Critical Injuries.</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0 (Weapon Mod)</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Mod Catalog &gt; Weapon Mods).</em></p>"
